WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.500 --> 00:00:06.290
I was the first car on the Moon.

2
00:00:06.990 --> 00:00:11.750
I folded up like origami to fit in the side of the lunar module.

3
00:00:12.450 --> 00:00:19.550
Dave and Jim drove me up mountain slopes at 13 km/h and called it the ride of their lives.

4
00:00:20.250 --> 00:00:25.670
When they left, they parked me so my camera could watch them blast off.

5
00:00:26.370 --> 00:00:30.570
The first car on the Moon, still parked at Hadley.
